<header class="essay-head"><p class="essay-kicker"><a href="/research-series">Research Series</a> · Essay 11 · <time datetime="2026-11-05">5 November 2026</time> · 19 min read</p><h1 class="essay-title">From Ruler to Enslaved</h1><p class="essay-sub">What Fifty Social Ladders Show Side by Side</p><p class="page-share-row"><button type="button" class="sp-share page-share" data-share-text="From Ruler to Enslaved: What Fifty Social Ladders Show Side by Side" data-share-title="From Ruler to Enslaved" data-share-heading="Share this essay" data-share-url="https://the-epoch-institute.org/essays/from-ruler-to-enslaved">Share</button></p></header>
